;; pyi's divergences from CPython 3.14.10 on the synthetic corpus and the samples (bin/reap's [:python :eval] source "pyi on
;; goi" and its [:python :aot] cell's second classes file; queue 201 PY10, doc/python/PYTHON-SURVEY.md, "As built: PY10"), in
;; test/goi/divergences.edn's format (GR10). The cases are bin/pyi check --aot's programs ("synth/DIR/NAME.py",
;; "samples/NAME.py"), their reason "RESULT REASON" as bin/reap's pyi-aot reader writes it from the record
;; (test/python/check-aot-linux-ARCH.edn): "as-pyi WHY" (the compiled run is the loop's and pyi's, not CPython's: the
;; interpreter's own divergence, judged once here for both levels), "pyi-differs ..." (pyi's run alone not CPython's) or
;; "reference-excluded WHY". The classes name their programs (:tests): the AOT judge's reason for a stdout difference is
;; only "stdout not CPython's", so a class is found by comparing the outputs (queue 201's sample run: bin/pyi check --aot
;; --no-pyi on the VM at 9e41dc00, 138 pass, these 13 :as-pyi; the outputs diffed against python3's). Each is the runtime's
;; (go/arbace/py, PY7-runtime's files) unless it says otherwise; a fixed program leaves its class (bin/reap: a class that
;; names a passing program is harmless, but prune it with the record; PY7-runtime fixed the runtime's 12, their 8 classes removed
;; at queue 201's integration). Read with the Clojure reader.
[
 {:id :finalization
  :title "finalization: __del__ at the point CPython's reference counting runs it"
  :kind :design
  :owner "none (by design: PYS9 (a), divergences.edn's :finalization)"
  :why "pyi's objects are Go's, collected by Go's collector: a __del__ CPython runs when the last reference goes (del x, a rebinding) runs later or not at all before exit (survey §6.5, PYS9)"
  :decided "PYS9 (a), survey §6.5; the user, 2026-11-04, (a): reference counting's moment by design"
  :tests ["synth/datamodel/del.py"]}
 {:id :reference-excluded
  :title "a reference CPython's own two runs disagree on, or whose output names the machine"
  :kind :design
  :owner "none (by design)"
  :why "bin/pyi record-ref writes such a program :excluded (survey §8.1): there is nothing to judge it against"
  :decided "GTS207 (a), PYS14 (a); PY4"
  :match [#"^reference-excluded "]}
]
